        "x1": 0.8292084033613446,
        "y1": 0.7786508313539192
      },
      "text": "Now we shall state and prove the lemma we have used above. Lemma 5.1. Let Ω ⊂ RN be an open, bounded and connected domain. If w1,w2 ∈ W1,p(x)(Ω) with:",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
